":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"166715","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55855","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50712","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83996","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"79981","synopsis":"Ciel decides to pay back Maurice Cole for his underhanded trick. Since Maurice lives in a different boarding house, he arranges a special exemption for an acquaintance to be admitted to Weston so that he can monitor Maurice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1e2N1XBorJ9dNmCXpoMEdrIthr0.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"166715","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55855","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50712","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83996","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"80185","synopsis":"Ciel wins the P4's trust, but he still can't find a chance to get close to the Head Master. And so he brings up the subject of Derrick Arden with the P4 and their drudges. When he does, the expressions on the prefects' faces change...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aBPjzBRUs4sjRPyJGsumm7K0cGu.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"166715","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55855","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50712","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83996","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"80457","synopsis":"Ciel hears some promising information: the ever-busy Head Master will be attending Weston's traditional cricket tournament, and evidently the student who exhibits the most sportsmanlike behaviour will be invited to the Head Master's \"midnight tea party.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lPOOSRdrEcikCsh5xwNdoJXf2SY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"166715","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55855","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50712","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83996","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"80737","synopsis":"Ciel is chosen to play cricket, but the boys of Sapphire Owl House are the perennial wooden spooners. They've had just one victory in the history of the tournament. Ciel resolves to wrest another victory for his House—without any miracles.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5t3eqjVEXcwzA8Ij7TFLZGHcO4Z.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18100","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"166715","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55855","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"50712","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"83996","scope":"s4","seasonNumber":4,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"81154","synopsis":"Ciel and the rest of Sapphire Owl House have won their way into the deciding match. As the cricketers exercise their talents to the fullest, Sebastian pursues the Head Master, who has appeared at last.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/prwCkcwW1Y9NZNgFiPanxOPoDQ6.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpiso